{
  "description": "ADR-004 step 8 payload hash test vectors. Loaded by each service's own unit tests (ADR-007).",
  "canonical_form": "JSON object of exactly action_id, amount_minor, currency, order_id; keys sorted; separators ',' and ':'; non-ASCII as raw UTF-8; amount_minor an integer; no normalization of any value",
